      "skos:note": "Revocation of parole order or licence without notice in certain circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-1-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 After paragraph 19AU(3)(b)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(ba) in the opinion of the Attorney-General it is necessary to\nrevoke the parole order or licence without giving notice to\nthe person in the interests of ensuring the safety and\nprotection of the community or of another person; or"
    },
    {
