      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to\nproceedings begun on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n\nStrengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to\nproceedings begun on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n\nStrengthening child sex offences  Schedule 4\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
