    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-471",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "471 25A  Using a postal or similar service to “groom” another person",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-4-sec-471"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "to make it easier to procure persons under 16\n\n(1) A person (the sender) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the sender causes an article to be carried by a postal or\nsimilar service to another person (the recipient); and\n\n(b) the sender does this with the intention of making it easier to\nprocure a person (the child) to engage in sexual activity with\nthe sender; and\n\n(c) the child is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be,\nunder 16; and\n\n(d) the sender is at least 18.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 15 years.\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences",
      "skos:definition": "to make it easier to procure persons under 16\n\n(1) A person (the sender) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the sender causes an article to be carried by a postal or\nsimilar service to another person (the recipient); and\n\n(b) the sender does this with the intention of making it easier to\nprocure a person (the child) to engage in sexual activity with\nthe sender; and\n\n(c) the child is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be,\nunder 16; and\n\n(d) the sender is at least 18.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 15 years.\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-471-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-471-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c90c5b440a49c2c9eedf47ba6bb8a4f3a0125039cce2cfeb4bbc266280f37cc2",
      "skos:note": "Using a postal or similar service to groom another person under 16 is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-4-sec-471",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "471 25A  Using a postal or similar service to “groom” another person",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "to make it easier to procure persons under 16\n\n(1) A person (the sender) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the sender causes an article to be carried by a postal or\nsimilar service to another person (the recipient); and\n\n(b) the sender does this with the intention of making it easier to\nprocure a person (the child) to engage in sexual activity with\nthe sender; and\n\n(c) the child is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be,\nunder 16; and\n\n(d) the sender is at least 18.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 15 years.\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-471-norm",
