    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(4) 23A  Conduct for the purposes of electronic service used for",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-4-sec-474-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this Code:\nelectronic service means a service a purpose of which is to:\n\n(a) allow persons to access material using a carriage service; or\n\n(b) deliver material to persons having equipment appropriate for\nreceiving that material, where the delivery of the service is by\nmeans of a carriage service;\nbut does not include:\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this Code:\nelectronic service means a service a purpose of which is to:\n\n(a) allow persons to access material using a carriage service; or\n\n(b) deliver material to persons having equipment appropriate for\nreceiving that material, where the delivery of the service is by\nmeans of a carriage service;\nbut does not include:\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-4-sec-474-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1fba21be21f0572fe2510d6758084c714c51e3d477ca883b4f235cb5ae244fab",
      "skos:note": "Definition of electronic service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-4-sec-474-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(4) 23A  Conduct for the purposes of electronic service used for",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this Code:\nelectronic service means a service a purpose of which is to:\n\n(a) allow persons to access material using a carriage service; or\n\n(b) deliver material to persons having equipment appropriate for\nreceiving that material, where the delivery of the service is by\nmeans of a carriage service;\nbut does not include:\n\nSchedule 4  Strengthening child sex offences"
    },
