      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\nProof of belief about age—evidence of representation\n\n(3) For the purposes of sections 474.26, 474.27, 474.27AA and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\nProof of belief about age—evidence of representation\n\n(3) For the purposes of sections 474.26, 474.27, 474.27AA and",
