    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 After section 16AA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-6-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n16AAA  Minimum penalties for certain offences\n\nSubject to section 16AAC, if a person is convicted of an offence\ndescribed in column 1 of an item in the following table, the court\nmust impose a sentence of imprisonment of at least the period\nspecified in column 2 of that item.\n\nMinimum penalty\nItem\nColumn 1\nOffence\nColumn 2\nSentence of imprisonment\noffence against subsection 272.8(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.8(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against section 272.10 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.11 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.18 of the\n6 years\n\nSchedule 6  Minimum sentences",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n16AAA  Minimum penalties for certain offences\n\nSubject to section 16AAC, if a person is convicted of an offence\ndescribed in column 1 of an item in the following table, the court\nmust impose a sentence of imprisonment of at least the period\nspecified in column 2 of that item.\n\nMinimum penalty\nItem\nColumn 1\nOffence\nColumn 2\nSentence of imprisonment\noffence against subsection 272.8(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.8(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against section 272.10 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.11 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.18 of the\n6 years\n\nSchedule 6  Minimum sentences",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-6-sec-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "63525e89dfa5cfbde7b4af70a7a493b5b7ad67afd0b6676807fd5301ad358639",
      "skos:note": "Minimum penalties for certain offences"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-6-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 After section 16AA",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n16AAA  Minimum penalties for certain offences\n\nSubject to section 16AAC, if a person is convicted of an offence\ndescribed in column 1 of an item in the following table, the court\nmust impose a sentence of imprisonment of at least the period\nspecified in column 2 of that item.\n\nMinimum penalty\nItem\nColumn 1\nOffence\nColumn 2\nSentence of imprisonment\noffence against subsection 272.8(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.8(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n6 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(1)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against subsection 272.9(2)\nof the Criminal Code\n5 years\noffence against section 272.10 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.11 of the\nCriminal Code\n7 years\noffence against section 272.18 of the\n6 years\n\nSchedule 6  Minimum sentences"
    },
