      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the bail authority is a court and it grants bail, the court must:\n\n(a) state its reasons; and\n\n(b) cause those reasons to be entered in the court’s records.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the bail authority is a court and it grants bail, the court must:\n\n(a) state its reasons; and\n\n(b) cause those reasons to be entered in the court’s records.",
      "values:partOf": {
