    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-4-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(5) After section 15AA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-7-sec-4-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An appeal under subsection (4):\n\n(a) may be made to a court that would ordinarily have\njurisdiction to hear and determine appeals (however\ndescribed) from directions, orders or judgments of the bail\nauthority referred to in subsection (4), whether the\njurisdiction is in respect of appeals relating to bail or appeals\nrelating to other matters; and\n\n(b) is to be made in accordance with the rules or procedures (if\nany) applicable under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or\na Territory in relation to the exercise of such jurisdiction.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An appeal under subsection (4):\n\n(a) may be made to a court that would ordinarily have\njurisdiction to hear and determine appeals (however\ndescribed) from directions, orders or judgments of the bail\nauthority referred to in subsection (4), whether the\njurisdiction is in respect of appeals relating to bail or appeals\nrelating to other matters; and\n\n(b) is to be made in accordance with the rules or procedures (if\nany) applicable under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or\na Territory in relation to the exercise of such jurisdiction.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-4-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-4-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e2a1ac33f45fe07c74cc85030d27164668f51690d615ff57938addcbbd85d91f",
      "skos:note": "Appeal under subsection (4) may be made to a court with jurisdiction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-7-sec-4-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(5) After section 15AA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(5) An appeal under subsection (4):\n\n(a) may be made to a court that would ordinarily have\njurisdiction to hear and determine appeals (however\ndescribed) from directions, orders or judgments of the bail\nauthority referred to in subsection (4), whether the\njurisdiction is in respect of appeals relating to bail or appeals\nrelating to other matters; and\n\n(b) is to be made in accordance with the rules or procedures (if\nany) applicable under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or\na Territory in relation to the exercise of such jurisdiction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-4-ss-5-norm",
