    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Application provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-7-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a decision,\nmade on or after the commencement of this Part, by a bail authority\nwhether to grant bail to a person charged with, or convicted of, an\noffence (whether the person was charged with, or convicted of, the\noffence before, on or after that commencement).\n(2)\nIf conduct that occurred before the commencement of this Part:\n\n(a) constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence before that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) does not constitute a Commonwealth child sex offence on or\nafter that commencement;\nsection 15AAA of the Crimes Act 1914 as inserted by this Part applies\nin relation to that conduct as if, on or after that commencement, that\nconduct constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence.\n\nMatters court has regard to when passing sentence etc.  Schedule 8\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a decision,\nmade on or after the commencement of this Part, by a bail authority\nwhether to grant bail to a person charged with, or convicted of, an\noffence (whether the person was charged with, or convicted of, the\noffence before, on or after that commencement).\n(2)\nIf conduct that occurred before the commencement of this Part:\n\n(a) constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence before that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) does not constitute a Commonwealth child sex offence on or\nafter that commencement;\nsection 15AAA of the Crimes Act 1914 as inserted by this Part applies\nin relation to that conduct as if, on or after that commencement, that\nconduct constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence.\n\nMatters court has regard to when passing sentence etc.  Schedule 8\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-7-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "96134d54d8335c6b4192a43ec7ae9fa10a89e869038fa6fbaf40697493e4951d",
      "skos:note": "Amendment applies to decisions made on or after commencement regarding bail for persons charged with or convicted of certain offences."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-7-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Application provisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a decision,\nmade on or after the commencement of this Part, by a bail authority\nwhether to grant bail to a person charged with, or convicted of, an\noffence (whether the person was charged with, or convicted of, the\noffence before, on or after that commencement).\n(2)\nIf conduct that occurred before the commencement of this Part:\n\n(a) constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence before that\ncommencement; and\n\n(b) does not constitute a Commonwealth child sex offence on or\nafter that commencement;\nsection 15AAA of the Crimes Act 1914 as inserted by this Part applies\nin relation to that conduct as if, on or after that commencement, that\nconduct constituted a Commonwealth child sex offence.\n\nMatters court has regard to when passing sentence etc.  Schedule 8\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020"
    },
    {
