      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-8-sec-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Subsection 272.30(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-9-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "Omit all the words after “the court” (first occurring), substitute:\n\nmust take into account the following matters:\n\n(a) the age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the\noffence was committed;\n\n(b) if that person was under 10 when the offence was\ncommitted—that fact as a reason for aggravating the\nseriousness of the criminal behaviour to which the offence\nrelates;\n\n(c) the number of people involved in the commission of the\noffence.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit all the words after “the court” (first occurring), substitute:\n\nmust take into account the following matters:\n\n(a) the age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the\noffence was committed;\n\n(b) if that person was under 10 when the offence was\ncommitted—that fact as a reason for aggravating the\nseriousness of the criminal behaviour to which the offence\nrelates;\n\n(c) the number of people involved in the commission of the\noffence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a5c0ed9e9071269435101e46018b8e5647e48df42e4cc7d9d35c7337fb706f8",
      "skos:note": "Court must consider age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the offence was committed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-9-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Subsection 272.30(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "Omit all the words after “the court” (first occurring), substitute:\n\nmust take into account the following matters:\n\n(a) the age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the\noffence was committed;\n\n(b) if that person was under 10 when the offence was\ncommitted—that fact as a reason for aggravating the\nseriousness of the criminal behaviour to which the offence\nrelates;\n\n(c) the number of people involved in the commission of the\noffence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the court must take into account the following matters:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 After subsection 272.30(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-9-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) However, the court need only take into account a matter mentioned\nin subsection (1) so far as the matter is known to the court and, for\na matter mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (c), relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) However, the court need only take into account a matter mentioned\nin subsection (1) so far as the matter is known to the court and, for\na matter mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (c), relevant.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8ea28c4a55dd0f8445e75ca2fe3f85544c43b5b5c41c7e5c1b73411e6ec541f5",
      "skos:note": "Court must consider only known matters in its decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-9-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 After subsection 272.30(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) However, the court need only take into account a matter mentioned\nin subsection (1) so far as the matter is known to the court and, for\na matter mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (c), relevant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-9-sec-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
