          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-2-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-2-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fad0e8b0b12895e68dd09f7c017abb6be05275d8f8a1bce4ee4a3742dacb5e21",
      "skos:note": "Court must state reasons for imposing sentence",
      "dc:description": "reasons for imposing sentence"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-10-sec-2-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(7) At the end of section 19",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the court imposes a term of imprisonment other than in\naccordance with subsection (5), the court must:\n\n(a) state its reasons for imposing the sentence in that manner;\nand\n\n(b) cause the reasons to be entered in the records of the court."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-2-ss-7-norm",
