      },
      "cml:conclusionText": "state reasons"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Application provision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-10-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an order\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule, directing when\nsentences commence, where the offences to which the sentences relate\nwere committed on or after that commencement.\n\nConditional release of offenders after conviction  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an order\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule, directing when\nsentences commence, where the offences to which the sentences relate\nwere committed on or after that commencement.\n\nConditional release of offenders after conviction  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "34579c6586ac0e5713598eb310e18516b1ed2d7850e76074ec1a497b5255a1f0",
      "skos:note": "Applicability of amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-10-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Application provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an order\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule, directing when\nsentences commence, where the offences to which the sentences relate\nwere committed on or after that commencement.\n\nConditional release of offenders after conviction  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 70, 2020\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-10-sec-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-11-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Paragraph 20(1)(b)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-11-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2020a00070.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) sentence the person to imprisonment in respect of the offence\nor each offence but direct, by order, that the person be\nreleased, upon giving security of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (a):\n\n(i) if none of the offences is a Commonwealth child sex\noffence—either immediately or after the person has\nserved a specified period of imprisonment that is\ncalculated in accordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(ii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is not satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—after the person has served\na specified period of imprisonment that is calculated in\naccordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(iii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—immediately.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) sentence the person to imprisonment in respect of the offence\nor each offence but direct, by order, that the person be\nreleased, upon giving security of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (a):\n\n(i) if none of the offences is a Commonwealth child sex\noffence—either immediately or after the person has\nserved a specified period of imprisonment that is\ncalculated in accordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(ii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is not satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—after the person has served\na specified period of imprisonment that is calculated in\naccordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(iii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—immediately.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-11-sec-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-11-sec-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bd4c69adeeb2bc823225bba86935e60c70d159f07e48fbf95c35f17be609dabb",
      "skos:note": "Directs that a person be released upon giving security, with conditions depending on the nature of the offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-11-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Paragraph 20(1)(b)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) sentence the person to imprisonment in respect of the offence\nor each offence but direct, by order, that the person be\nreleased, upon giving security of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (a):\n\n(i) if none of the offences is a Commonwealth child sex\noffence—either immediately or after the person has\nserved a specified period of imprisonment that is\ncalculated in accordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(ii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is not satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—after the person has served\na specified period of imprisonment that is calculated in\naccordance with subsection 19AF(1); or\n\n(iii) if at least one of the offences is a Commonwealth child\nsex offence and the court is satisfied that there are\nexceptional circumstances—immediately."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-11-sec-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
