      },
      "dc:source": "c2020a00070.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to a sentence\npassed, or an order made, on or after the commencement of this\nSchedule, in respect of a person convicted before, on or after that\ncommencement.\n\nSchedule 13  Revocation of parole order or licence\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020\nNo. 70, 2020",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to a sentence\npassed, or an order made, on or after the commencement of this\nSchedule, in respect of a person convicted before, on or after that\ncommencement.\n\nSchedule 13  Revocation of parole order or licence\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020\nNo. 70, 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2020a00070-sch-12-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "09b73ee73b0659b24a79eb7faa66e84377c1be696ef85fbc8749423c8416b274",
      "skos:note": "Application provision for amendments made by this Schedule"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2020a00070#sch-12-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Application provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to a sentence\npassed, or an order made, on or after the commencement of this\nSchedule, in respect of a person convicted before, on or after that\ncommencement.\n\nSchedule 13  Revocation of parole order or licence\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Sexual Crimes Against Children and\nCommunity Protection Measures) Act 2020\nNo. 70, 2020"
    },
